Third-party components in the macOS app
----------------------------------------
The box sandbox runtime (docs/boxes-spec.md) ships inside Fletch.app:

- libkrun 1.19.6 — Contents/Frameworks/libkrun.1.dylib. Apache-2.0.
  https://github.com/libkrun/libkrun, built from the v1.19.6 source tarball
  with the patches in packaging/libkrun/patches (packaging/libkrun/build.sh).

- libkrunfw 5.6.2 — Contents/Frameworks/libkrunfw.5.dylib, a bundled Linux
  6.12 kernel. GPL-2.0 (with the Linux-syscall-note). The build pins the
  prebuilt bundle libkrunfw-prebuilt-aarch64.tgz from
  https://github.com/libkrun/libkrunfw/releases/tag/v5.6.2; the corresponding
  source is that tagged tree (the Makefile names the exact kernel tarball from
  kernel.org and the config it is built with, config-libkrunfw_aarch64):
  https://github.com/libkrun/libkrunfw/tree/v5.6.2

- The box base image is not in the app bundle; it is downloaded on demand
  from this repository's GitHub release tagged box-image-v<version>. It is a
  Debian root filesystem (packaging/box-image): every package's licence is in
  the image under /usr/share/doc/<package>/copyright, and the release's
  manifest.json lists the packages with their versions.
